All 15 tests pass. Here's a summary of the fixes:

**`src/auth.py`**
- `has_permission`: Added case-insensitive comparison using `any(r.lower() == required_lower for r in user_roles)`
- `is_admin_or_owner`: Changed `and` to `or` — owner should be checked independently of admin role

**`src/inventory.py`**
- `__init__`: Changed mutable default `{}` to `None`, then `dict(initial) if initial else {}` to prevent shared state
- `add`: Accumulate with `self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty` instead of overwriting
- `reserve`: Changed `>=` to `>` so reserving exactly the available amount succeeds
- `release`: Added guard `if current - qty < 0: raise ValueError(...)` to prevent negative reservations

**`src/text_utils.py`**
- `slugify`: Applied `.lower()` to input characters; replaced single `replace("--", "-")` with `while "--" in collapsed` loop to collapse multiple separators
- `truncate`: Changed `text[:max_len] + suffix` to `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix` so total length including suffix stays within `max_len`
